./salib.js is a JavaScript port of methods and refinements from SALib, the
Python library for sensitivity analysis, https://github.com/SALib/SALib
(v1.6.0): PAWN, discrepancy, the radial one-at-a-time design with its
elementary effects and Jansen total index, Morris's trajectories with the
optimal-trajectory selection, the bootstrap intervals on Morris's mu*, the
Sobol indices and DGSM's nu, the fractional factorial's interaction effects
and the RBD-FAST bias correction. SALib is licensed as follows.

